WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Welcome to MODE — an adaptive Video.js v10 skin engineered for every viewing occasion.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.500
In Movie Mode, deep crimson velvet and champagne gold frame the cinema viewport without distraction.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:21.000
In Music Mode, offscreen canvas edge sampling reflects live video colors onto the frosted cyberpunk controls.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.500
In Study Mode, Video.js v10 media-i18n and live dual-caption translation empower focused learning.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:38.000
In Chill and Skeleton modes, switch effortlessly between liquid-glass serenity and a 75% transparent wireframe.

